# Client-facing and work-confidential output
# Added 2026-08-24 after a `git add -A` swept all of this toward a PUBLIC origin.
# Every path here is work-confidential and lives in the working tree untracked,
# which is one careless add away from being published. The wall only works if it
# is written down.
# NOTE: gitignore has no trailing comments — a `#` on a pattern line becomes
# part of the pattern and the rule silently matches nothing. Comments go above.

# Client handoff documents
outputs/
For Crew/
Previous Crew/
# per-client demo builds
demos/
decks/
CLAUDE-DEMO.md
# .real-backup / .demo-backup — CLAUDE.md itself is already ignored above
CLAUDE.md.*
# Omni query-result payloads
qres.json

# Generated indexes and caches. These apps read the confidential source above,
# so anything they derive carries it verbatim — account names, deal stages, AE
# names, renewal dates, licence counts. Verified 2026-08-24. The app CODE is
# clean and stays tracked; only the derived data is walled off. Regenerate
# locally with the build scripts.
file-explorer/docx_cache/
file-explorer/search_index.json
file-explorer/tree.json
library-app/index.json

